  "transcript": "Goatly is my ongoing concept-based language-learning platform for children with language delays and multilingual backgrounds.\n\nIt connects educators, caregivers, and the languages spoken at home.\n\nThe idea is to make visual communication support more engaging through personalised characters, voices, playful activities, and learning journeys connected to real-world experiences.\n\nThe project began with Go and Encore. I’m now rebuilding it in C sharp and dot net using Clean Architecture.\n\nMy work includes permissions, child-safe access to media, databases, automated testing, and maintainable system boundaries.\n\nA public code example and a live demo are linked in the project section.",
